A link exists if the LLR implements, refines, or decomposes the HLR.
High-Level Requirement:
  Summary: Data Index Implementation to Kogito Operator
  Description: In this EPIC we will focus on implementing the Data Index and it's dependencies via Kogito Operator
Low-Level Requirement:
  Summary: Deploy Kogito Data Index when creating a new project on Kogito CLI
  Description: Whenever the Operator have the feature to deploy Infinispan/Strimzi automatically with default values, the CLI must follow this user story and deploy the data index with this command:
{code}
kogito new-project my-kogito
{code}
An user can disable this deploy by setting:
{code} 
kogito new-project my-kogito --data-index=false
{code}
Today we have the option to deploy the data index independently on the project:
{code}
kogito install data-index --kafka-url <url> --infinispan-url <url>
{code}
